  "description": "Lightweight, high-performance HTML response caching for Static Server-Side Rendered (SSR) Blazor pages. Dramatically improve page load times (20-50x faster) with declarative [PageCache] attributes. Features include cache stampede prevention, tag-based invalidation, flexible cache keys, compression support, security validation, and comprehensive diagnostics. Best for static SSR pages and static wrappers with selective component-level interactivity.",
